SOP: Create User (kareem) with Expiry Date on App Server 1

Section                     Details
----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
Objective                   Create user 'kareem' on App Server 1 with an account expiry date.

Pre-Requisites              SSH access to App Server 1, sudo/root privileges.

Step 1                      SSH to App Server 1:
                            ssh tony@172.16.238.10

Step 2                      Switch to root user:
                            sudo su -

Step 3                      Verify current users:
                            cat /etc/passwd

Step 4                      Create the user 'kareem':
                            useradd kareem

Expected Output             User 'kareem' will be added with default home directory /home/kareem
                            and shell /bin/bash.

Step 5                      Set account expiry date (March 28, 2024):
                            usermod -e 2024-03-28 kareem

Step 6                      Verify account expiration settings:
                            chage -l kareem

Expected Output             Last password change    : <current date>
                            Password expires        : never
                            Account expires         : Mar 28, 2024
                            Other fields as default.

Rollback                    Delete user and home directory:
                            userdel -r kareem

End State                   User 'kareem' created successfully with account expiry set to
                            March 28, 2024.
----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
